<p dir="auto">Each of these has just data for the basic feature, all of which were supported since wasm 1.0 (so, same data as, say, webassembly-api.Memory), or the basic data plus a sub-data point for that instruction used with v128 or v128 value interpretations (same as webassembly.fixed-width-SIMD).</p>
